  "releaseNotes": "1.3.1 - AI moderation calls now time out after 8 seconds and fall back to the deterministic rules verdict, so a stalled provider can no longer hold a member's submit request open. Works with Community Forum, Community Comments, or both. See CHANGELOG.md.",
